          <rdf:li>Grinding</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Take a shot every time Double Trouble says kitten or darling and you'll die</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Rough Kissing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I make Catra happy only to hurt her more</rdf:li>
